# Apache / WHM — PradytecAI on shared /home/pradytec/public_html
#
# cPanel: pradytecai.com DocumentRoot = /home/pradytec/public_html
# deploy.sh copies deploy/apache/pradytecai-public_html.htaccess → public_html/.htaccess
# (backs up a Laravel index.php front-controller once as .htaccess.laravel.bak).
#
# That file (between # BEGIN PRADYTECAI / # END PRADYTECAI):
#   1) Proxies /api/v1 /up /health /t /django-admin /contact … → 127.0.0.1:8100
#   2) SPA-fallback to /index.html for React routes (/login /admin /products …)
#   3) Leaves real dirs alone (crm/ dashboard/ analyzer/ assets/ images/ static/ media/ …)
#
# Sibling subdomain vhosts (crm.pradytecai.com, etc.) use their own DocumentRoots —
# this root .htaccess does not control them.
#
# Requires: mod_rewrite + mod_proxy + mod_proxy_http (usual on EA4).
# If [P] proxy rules 500, enable proxy in WHM or use VirtualHost ProxyPass instead.
#
# Verify after install:
#   curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8100/up
#   curl -fsS -H "Host: pradytecai.com" http://127.0.0.1/up
#   curl -sI -H "Host: pradytecai.com" http://127.0.0.1/login | head -5
#   curl -sI https://crm.pradytecai.com/ | head -5
#   ls /home/pradytec/public_html/assets /home/pradytec/public_html/images
